{"id":"sanctorale.11-03.german-speaking-2","source":"santos/santos_nov#1103Z","kind":"sanctoral","items":[{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"[In den Diözesen deutscher Sprache]"}]]}]},"part":"title","role":"rubric"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h2","lines":[["3. November"],["Hl. Hubert, Bischof"]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Die Hubertuslegende stammt aus dem 11. Jh., nach der Hubert an einem Karfreitag zur Jagd gegangen war und er sich bekehrte, weil ihm ein Hirsch mit einem Kreuz zwischen dem Geweih begegnete. Sicher ist, dass Hubert um 705 Bischof von Maastricht wurde. Er missionierte in Südbrabant und in den Ardennen, damals noch ein großes Waldgebiet, wohin das Christentum kaum vorgedrungen war. Hubert starb am 30. Mai 727 in der Nähe von Brüssel."]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Commune-Texte für Bischöfe:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"1","to":"common.pastors.3"},{"m":"link","t":"2","to":"common.pastors.4"}],[{"m":"rubric","t":"."}]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Tagesgebet"]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Gott, du Licht der Gläubigen, du hast den heiligen Bischof Hubert dazu berufen, der Kirche durch sein Wort und Beispiel zu dienen. Seine Fürsprache helfe uns, den Glauben zu bewahren, den er in seiner Predigt gelehrt, und den Weg zu gehen, den er uns durch sein Leben gewiesen hat. Darum bitten wir durch Jesus Christus."]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"slot":"61","text":{"la":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Præfatio"]]}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefácio"]]}],"en-US":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Preface"]]}],"es":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefacio"]]}],"it":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefazio"]]}],"fr":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Préface"]]}],"de":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Präfation"]]}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true},{"slot":"62","text":{"la":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"De sanctis pastoribus "},{"m":"link","t":"... Quia sic tríbuis Ecclésiam tuam sancti...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Dos Santos Pastores "},{"m":"link","t":"...Vós nos concedeis a alegria...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"en-US":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"HOLY PASTORS "},{"m":"link","t":"... For, as on the festival of Saint...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"es":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Santos Pastores "},{"m":"link","t":"... Porque nos concedes la alegría...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"it":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"DEI SANTI PASTORI "},{"m":"link","t":"... Tu doni alla tua Chiesa...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"fr":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Des Pasteurs "},{"m":"link","t":"... Tu donnes à ton Église de se réjouir..","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"de":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"HIRTEN DER KIRCHE "},{"m":"link","t":"... am Fest des heiligen N. deine Größe...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true}],"precedence":12.0,"prefaces":["preface.56"],"commons":["common.pastors.3","common.pastors.4"],"title":{"*":"Hl. Hubert, Bischof"}}
